#
# download-binaries.sh reads this file, and nothing else in the repo names a
# version or a checksum.
#
# hanzo-node: the daemon the app spawns and drives over HTTP, one archive per
# target on the hanzoai/node-v1 release for the version. The repository is
# private, so the script needs GH_TOKEN. Each archive's sha256 is pinned: a
# download that does not match fails the build. The release's binaries.json
# lists the same digests.
